OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLong spells of autumnal
OL,6,Fsunshine in the morning though icy
OL,7,Fstretches may make for difficult
OL,8,Ftravelling conditions. Remaining cold
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon, and sun will
OL,10,Flater be dimmed by cloud. Ice in shady
OL,11,Fspots may not thaw during the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA breezy, dry evening.
OL,14,FStrengthening winds and rain will
OL,15,Farrive during the early hours,
OL,16,Ffreezing onto some roads. For the
OL,17,FPennines and Wainwrights, this will
OL,18,Ffall as snow.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
