OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA very wet day to come on
OL,6,FTuesday, with heavy and persistent
OL,7,Frain at times. Strong winds towards
OL,8,Fthe coast and over hills through the
OL,9,Fmorning, easing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FRemaining chilly over the next few
OL,13,Fdays with frosty nights. Wednesday
OL,14,Fbrings further spells of rain, before
OL,15,Fturning drier and brighter through
OL,16,FThursday and into Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
